      "writtenOn": "2026-11-03T08:15:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This can lead to OOM. Streamed bodies no longer pass HttpObjectAggregator, so nothing enforces maxRequestBodySize any more. A chunked PUT of any size is accepted, and a pipelined request queued in RestconfSession buffers its whole body unread. The parent change listed this as a precondition for enabling streaming, and RequestBodyInputStream expects the handler to enforce it.",
      "revId": "d1ed5ea0622e00f924dd519a528fde3640d7d6bb",
